          "type": "step",
          "id": "infiltrating-h-a-m:6q8j2y",
          "html": "With a light source, head to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lumbridge_Swamp_Caves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lumbridge Swamp Caves</a> entrance north-west of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Water_altar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Water altar</a>.",
          "text": "With a light source, head to the Lumbridge Swamp Caves entrance north-west of the Water altar.",
