          "id": "infiltrating-h-a-m:treamr",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sergeant_Slimetoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sergeant Slimetoes</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sergeant_Mossfists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mossfists</a> outside the entrance to the Lumbridge Swamp Caves.",
